From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: momokind <momokind2002@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:52:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [VideoPlayer] Add Dolby Vision to HDR10 / 10-bit SDR (WCG-SDR) dynamic tone-mapping output

Drive pi-dv-engine's PI_OUT_HDR10 and PI_OUT_SDR (BT.709 / WCG-SDR BT.2020)
modes from Kodi so Dolby Vision streams (Profile 5 IPTPQc2, Profile 7
FEL/MEL, Profile 8.1, HDR Vivid -> DV) render cleanly on non-DV HDR10 TVs
and SDR monitors/projectors using 10-bit XRGB2101010 scanout and per-frame
RPU L1 BT.2390 EETF dynamic tone mapping.
